Fragsook is an India-based online fragrance and personal-care e-commerce platform founded in 2022 by Ejaz Ahmad Siddiqui. The brand was created with the aim of building a digital-first destination where customers can discover and purchase a wide range of perfumes, attars, deodorants, and other fragrance products from international, Arabian, and Middle Eastern fragrance brands. Through its online platform, Fragsook focuses on making fragrance discovery more convenient by bringing different perfume styles, brands, fragrance families, and price ranges together in one place.

Since its establishment, Fragsook has focused on creating an online shopping experience for customers who are interested in perfumes and personal fragrances. The platform allows customers to explore products according to their preferred scent profiles, fragrance notes, occasions, brands, and product types. The official website provides detailed product information to help customers understand a fragrance before making a purchase.

Fragsook operates primarily in the online fragrance retail and e-commerce industry. Its product range includes Eau de Parfum (EDP), Eau de Toilette (EDT), Extrait de Parfum, perfumes, attars, deodorants, and perfumed body sprays. The catalogue includes products for men, women, and unisex users, allowing customers with different preferences to explore suitable options. Product sizes vary according to the individual fragrance and brand, with products available in different bottle sizes and collections.

A major part of Fragsook's catalogue is its variety of fragrance profiles. Customers can find fresh and citrus-based compositions featuring ingredients such as bergamot, lemon, grapefruit, orange, mandarin, lime, and marine accords. The catalogue also includes woody fragrances built around cedarwood, sandalwood, vetiver, patchouli, guaiac wood, cashmeran, and other woody materials. Customers who prefer deeper and richer compositions can explore fragrances featuring oud, agarwood, saffron, incense, amber, leather, tobacco, resinous accords, and spices.

Fragsook also offers a range of gourmand and sweet fragrances. These compositions can include vanilla, caramel, praline, coffee, tonka bean, benzoin, candied fruits, creamy accords, and other sweet or edible-inspired notes. For customers who prefer floral fragrances, the catalogue includes compositions featuring rose, jasmine, tuberose, violet, magnolia, orange blossom, neroli, white flowers, and other floral accords. The variety allows customers to explore fragrances ranging from fresh and clean scents to warm, spicy, oriental, woody, gourmand, musky, and oud-focused compositions.

The platform features products from a variety of international and Middle Eastern fragrance brands. Brands represented in the Fragsook catalogue include Lattafa, Khadlaj, Rayhaan, Arabiyat Prestige, French Avenue, Fragrance World, Maison Alhambra, Paris Corner, Armaf, Ahmed Al Maghribi, Ibraheem Al Qurashi, Riiffs, Otoori, Ard Al Zaafaran, MyPerfumes, and Nautica, among others. The catalogue can change over time as new fragrances are introduced and existing products become unavailable.

Some of the fragrances represented across the catalogue include Lattafa Khamrah Qahwa, Khadlaj Empire Crown, Khadlaj Oud Al Sabah, Khadlaj Musk Al Sabah, Rayhaan Nava Sol, Rayhaan Italia Pour Homme, Rayhaan Pacific, Rayhaan Nocturno, Arabiyat Prestige Nyla, Arabiyat Prestige Nayel, Arabiyat Prestige Raees, Arabiyat Prestige Ramad, Arabiyat Prestige Swar, French Avenue Zenith Vanilla, French Avenue Zenith Deep, French Avenue Zenith Noire, French Avenue Proud Of You, Maison Alhambra Glacier Ultra, Maison Alhambra Dark Door Intense, Paris Corner Rifaaqat, Armaf Club De Nuit Sillage, Ahmed Al Maghribi Blu Oud, and Ibraheem Al Qurashi Blue Oud. These products cover a broad range of fragrance families and are not limited to one particular scent style.

Fragsook provides fragrance-related information on its product pages to help customers understand what they are purchasing. Depending on the product, customers may find details such as the fragrance family, main accords, top notes, heart notes, base notes, product size, and other product information. The use of top, heart, and base notes gives customers a clearer idea of how a fragrance can progress from its initial opening through the middle stage and eventually into the dry-down.

Fragrance discovery is particularly important when shopping online because customers cannot physically smell a perfume before placing an order. Fragsook therefore provides information about the composition and character of individual fragrances so that customers can compare different products based on their preferences. Someone looking for a fresh citrus scent, for example, can explore fragrances containing bergamot, lemon, grapefruit, orange, or marine accords, while customers who prefer richer scents can look for oud, amber, vanilla, tobacco, leather, coffee, or spicy compositions.

Fragsook's catalogue covers fragrances suitable for different occasions and lifestyles. Customers can explore options for everyday wear, office use, dates, parties, weddings, dinners, evening events, casual outings, travel, summer, winter, and other occasions. The suitability of a fragrance depends on its individual composition and the customer's personal preference, which is why the platform provides different fragrance styles rather than focusing on a single category.

The brand also caters to customers interested in Arabian and Middle Eastern perfumes. Several products in its catalogue feature ingredients and fragrance styles commonly associated with Middle Eastern perfumery, including oud, agarwood, saffron, amber, incense, musk, rose, spices, woods, vanilla, tobacco, and resinous accords. At the same time, Fragsook's catalogue includes fresh, citrus, floral, marine, clean, aromatic, and contemporary fragrances for customers who prefer lighter or more modern scent profiles.

Customer experience is an important part of Fragsook's online business. Customer reviews and feedback can provide insight into different aspects of the shopping experience, including product satisfaction, packaging, delivery, customer support, and overall purchasing experience. Individual reviews represent the experiences of specific customers and may naturally vary from one order to another. Fragsook can use customer feedback to identify areas for improvement and continue developing its online shopping experience.

Fragsook's services are primarily focused on online fragrance retail and fragrance discovery. Customers can browse the catalogue, explore individual products, learn about fragrance notes, compare different scent profiles, discover brands, and place orders through the website. The platform also provides customer assistance for relevant shopping and order-related queries according to its applicable policies.

Another important aspect of Fragsook is its digital-first approach. The brand operates primarily through its online presence, allowing customers to discover products without needing to visit a physical perfume store. Customers can reach the brand through its website and discover its products through online search, social media, product pages, fragrance-related content, and customer-generated feedback.

Fragsook is also focused on making perfume discovery easier for people who may already know the type of scent they enjoy but are not familiar with a particular product. For example, a customer who enjoys vanilla can explore fragrances where vanilla is combined with coffee, caramel, amber, tonka bean, woods, musk, or fruits. Similarly, someone interested in oud can explore compositions where oud is combined with rose, saffron, leather, amber, incense, patchouli, sandalwood, or other ingredients.

The broad catalogue allows Fragsook to serve both casual perfume buyers and fragrance enthusiasts. Someone looking for an everyday fragrance can explore fresh, citrus, aromatic, clean, or musky compositions, while customers looking for a more noticeable evening scent can explore oud, amber, tobacco, leather, gourmand, spicy, oriental, and woody fragrances. This variety gives customers the freedom to explore different fragrance personalities instead of being restricted to one particular perfume category.

Fragsook's product range continues to represent different fragrance families, including citrus, floral, woody, oud, amber, oriental, gourmand, musky, aromatic, spicy, marine, fruity, vanilla, leather, tobacco, and fresh fragrances. The combination of different fragrance families and brands makes the platform a destination for customers who want to explore both familiar and new fragrance profiles.

The brand's overall approach is centered around online accessibility, product variety, fragrance discovery, and customer convenience. By bringing together perfumes and fragrance products from different brands, Fragsook aims to provide customers with more choices while helping them understand the character of individual products before purchasing.

